OL,3,GNEWSA'Thuggish' robbers attacked
OL,4,Astudents on night out
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo "thuggish" robbers who attacked and
OL,7,Fthreatened students on a night out have
OL,8,Fbeen given a "chance" to turn their
OL,9,Flives around.
OL,11,FThe three victims were heading back to
OL,12,Ftheir accommodation in Sunderland in
OL,13,Fthe early hours of 19 March when James
OL,14,FCassop and Wesley Cowell pounced,
OL,15,FNewcastle Crown Court heard.
OL,17,FOne was hit with a wooden pole, another
OL,18,Fwas punched in the face and the third
OL,19,Fwas threatened into unlocking his phone
OL,20,Fby the pair, the court heard.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
