OL,3,GNEWSA'Thuggish' robbers attacked
OL,4,Astudents on night out
OL,5,
OL,6,FCassop, 18, and Cowell, 20, both
OL,7,Fadmitted robbery and attempted robbery
OL,8,Fand were given suspended prison
OL,9,Fsentences to address their drug
OL,10,Faddiction issues.
